From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 21:49:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] firmware: qcom: scm: Allow QSEECOM on the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim
 3x

The IdeaPad Slim 3x's tree carried the ThinkPad T14s compatible to get
onto this list. Give the laptop its own entry instead. Without QSEECOM
it has no EFI variables, so an installer cannot write its boot entry.

Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
 drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
index d53be9e..2842adb 100644
--- a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
+++ b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
@@ -2328,6 +2328,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id qcom_scm_qseecom_allowlist[] __maybe_unused = {
 	{ .compatible = "lenovo,ideacentre-mini-01q8x10" },
 	{ .compatible = "lenovo,ideapad-5" },
 	{ .compatible = "lenovo,ideapad-5-2in1" },
+	{ .compatible = "lenovo,ideapad-slim3" },
 	{ .compatible = "lenovo,thinkbook-16" },
 	{ .compatible = "lenovo,thinkpad-t14s" },
 	{ .compatible = "lenovo,thinkpad-t14s-gen7" },
-- 
2.47.3

